{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your domain as the Tentacle Mimic, guardian of the ancient dungeon. Adventurers have heard of your treasures. They seek to intrude your dungeon, to plunder your riches and disrupt your power. Capture the intruders and take them to the dungeon!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your tentacles and traps throughout your dungeon to fend off waves of female intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tentacles and traps to enhance their effectiveness and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/extras/6502f54cae5bb3620469e75a243df74e.avif?t=1769784221\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture and Corrupt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture intruders and bring them back to your dungeon. Build special chambers to hold and manage your captured intruders. Corrupt captured intruders and harness their energy to power up your dungeon and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/extras/7e53725e982afce3c0ea7358fc34f316.avif?t=1769784221\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of your dungeon to uncover hidden treasures and ancient artifacts. Expand your dungeon by excavating new areas and building additional chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/extras/3661320fcc4562be3f133275d45e6489.avif?t=1769784221\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742990?t=1769784221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742990?t=1769784221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/37cfbc3c38f15b04de2fdd97b0059bb4d481d858/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769784221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/37cfbc3c38f15b04de2fdd97b0059bb4d481d858/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769784221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some characters are wearing revealing outfits"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your domain as the Tentacle Mimic, guardian of the ancient dungeon. Adventurers have heard of your treasures. They seek to intrude your dungeon, to plunder your riches and disrupt your power. Capture the intruders and take them to the dungeon!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your tentacles and traps throughout your dungeon to fend off waves of female intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tentacles and traps to enhance their effectiveness and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742990/extras/6502f54cae5bb3620469e75a243df74e.avif?t=1769784221\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture and Corrupt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture intruders and bring them back to your dungeon. Build special chambers to hold and manage your captured intruders. Corrupt captured intruders and 